[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0010","text":"雾子，怎么了—？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0020","text":"海浪的声音……\n哗哗——……哗哗——地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0030","text":"好像……渗进心里来了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0040","text":"渗进来—？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0050","text":"嗯……\n还有……潮水的味道……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0060","text":"啊……──\n说起来，据说声音和气味是和记忆紧密相连的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0070","text":"啊确实。以那些为契机\n会想起各种各样的事情呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0080","text":"呵呵～\n我也想起了故乡的事情呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0090","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_03_0100","text":"这份记忆……一定也会……"}]
